## [Using the hardware appliance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/vgw/hardware-appliance.md)

- [Setting up your hardware appliance](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/vgw/appliance-quick-start.md): Set up and configure your Storage Gateway Hardware Appliance.
